# Frontend environment variables
# No secrets belong here: everything prefixed with VITE_ is embedded in the
# public browser bundle.
#
# Leave this unset in normal use.
# - Local dev: vite.config.js proxies /api to the Express dev server.
# - Vercel: the frontend and the API share one domain, so requests go to /api.
#
# Only set it if the API is hosted on a different origin, and make sure that
# origin is listed in the backend's CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
